Subject: [PATCH] MIPS: Ingenic: support XBurst cache management and SMP
Upstream-Status: Pending

Add XBurst and XBurst2 CPU detection, cache operations, TLB handling,
instruction emulation and idle support. Provide the Ingenic SMP startup,
mailbox and CPU hotplug implementation with its shared register definitions.

Use the Ingenic cache backend instead of the generic R4K backend. Drain the
external write buffer after DMA writeback/invalidate and XBurst receive
invalidation so subsequent device accesses see completed cache operations.

